    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into\u00a0<strong>Spellbound Emporium</strong> and become the new owner of a cozy gift shop in an enchanted world. <strong>Build</strong>, <strong>stock</strong> and <strong>grow</strong> your fantasy shop to become the biggest and <strong>most magical</strong> store in all the land! Greet a variety of fantastical characters, each on the hunt for <strong>unique</strong> and <strong>magic-infused items</strong> and with pockets laden with gold!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/d5f9371df63c32803182edb92e242859.poster.avif?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/d5f9371df63c32803182edb92e242859.webm?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/d5f9371df63c32803182edb92e242859.mp4?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/b54e7d94ed66c876a98f782687fa5c55.webp?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Furnish your shop</strong> with bookcases, decorations, shelves and <strong>stock your store</strong> with enchanted items, books, gifts and more! Every day brings a new type of customer looking for different books and items to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/3d4f8c91d65977f17f75a10c7f19a777.poster.avif?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/3d4f8c91d65977f17f75a10c7f19a777.webm?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/3d4f8c91d65977f17f75a10c7f19a777.mp4?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/42c253ef342f9222e8d6d11bea0ed733.webp?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow herbs</strong> and<strong> brew potions</strong>\u00a0to stock your shelves with a variety of potions to attract different types of customers. Whether a customers is an elf looking for a love potion or a dwarf after a deadly poison (keep is shush-shush!), get brewing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/324da54b92b8be48dd7015a320d379e5.poster.avif?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/324da54b92b8be48dd7015a320d379e5.webm?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/324da54b92b8be48dd7015a320d379e5.mp4?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/52c6a92a59f481bd9964866b600021fe.webp?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise</strong> your store completely - from the color of the walls and cases to the wall decorations, plants and much more. Fancy a wholesome cosy vibe to your store or a dark gothic store to cater to the infernal demons that like a spell book and a coffee?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/83186767ed81c5d2a9b873d7e0d4cb8c.poster.avif?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/83186767ed81c5d2a9b873d7e0d4cb8c.webm?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/83186767ed81c5d2a9b873d7e0d4cb8c.mp4?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/9da6af25a20a70543a790ee2d8b6ec46.webp?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong>\u00a0<strong>new items</strong> and <strong>more space</strong> for your store by reinvesting in <strong>expanding the store space</strong>, purchasing more furniture and sourcing new and enchanted stock and become the biggest and best magical store in all the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/6e4acbe7d7f4e33fe7cfb990332838ea.poster.avif?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/6e4acbe7d7f4e33fe7cfb990332838ea.webm?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/6e4acbe7d7f4e33fe7cfb990332838ea.mp4?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into\u00a0<strong>Spellbound Emporium</strong> and become the new owner of a cozy gift shop in an enchanted world. <strong>Build</strong>, <strong>stock</strong> and <strong>grow</strong> your fantasy shop to become the biggest and <strong>most magical</strong> store in all the land! Greet a variety of fantastical characters, each on the hunt for <strong>unique</strong> and <strong>magic-infused items</strong> and with pockets laden with gold!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/d5f9371df63c32803182edb92e242859.poster.avif?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/d5f9371df63c32803182edb92e242859.webm?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/d5f9371df63c32803182edb92e242859.mp4?t=1745858585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/b54e7d94ed66c876a98f782687fa5c55.webp?t=1745858585\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Furnish your shop</strong> with bookcases, decorations, shelves and <strong>stock your store</strong> with enchanted items, books, gifts and more! Every day brings a new type of customer looking for different books and items to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673300/extras/3d4f8c91d65977f17f75a10c7f19a777.poster.avif?t=1745858